5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about arrangements that collapse in year two. Let’s see where recent starts failed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to know if past initiatives actually helped patients. I’ll check what earlier attempts produced.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Rosters absorb the pressure. I need to see the staffing records to understand the load.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,The budget is often fiction. I need to know what this allocation can actually build.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,New things must fit the existing day. I’m concerned about whether the place can absorb it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, your caution is wise. We must ensure the foundation is solid before building.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, agreed. Understanding the past failures is key to avoiding repetition.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the budget is one thing, but the people are another. We need both.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, people are expensive. I need to see the real cost of the running side.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@All, let us look at the physical constraints too. Space is finite.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look into the board minutes on the jointly run clinic.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will review the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check this year's development allocation in the ledger.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will examine rooms, parking and shuttle coverage.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will also look at the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check what the booking system records.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will also review the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will also check regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
